    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55da3a2db7c2565c23504bdd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "硬是去凑一件武器，我也无法运用自如。\n既然如此……不如就紧握最重要的那样事物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5099b5cca9c97727c37490a59cb66123548a9ec878ce22e3a8cc0d6168cdf7d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
