      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "把我的心，连接给谋勇――\n你不觉得这也不失为一条美妙的道路吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "270703e19d87442354b0afab924fae4732e10b31be426ba74b2f4a932db4b341",
